  <h1>Privacy Notice</h1>

  <h3>What's collected</h3>
  <p>Only what you submit through the contact form on this site — your name, email address, and message. This site does not use analytics or tracking scripts.</p>

  <h3>Why</h3>
  <p>Solely to read and reply to your message.</p>

  <h3>Third party</h3>
  <p>The contact form is delivered by <a href="https://formspree.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Formspree</a>, which receives what you submit in order to email it to me. See Formspree's own privacy policy for how they handle that data in transit.</p>

  <h3>Retention</h3>
  <p>Messages are kept only as long as needed to respond to you. They are not sold, shared, or used for any purpose beyond replying to your inquiry.</p>

  <h3>Contact</h3>
  <p>Questions about this notice or your data can be sent to <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>

  <h3>This is separate from copyright</h3>
  <p>This notice covers data privacy only. Rules about reusing this site's content, design, or photography are in the footer copyright line on every page, not here.</p>

